{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/opaqueenrollment(password:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/opaqueEnrollment(password:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"opaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC16opaqueEnrollment8passwordAA06OpaqueE0VSS_tYaKF","title":"opaqueEnrollment(password:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"opaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The server cannot build this — it never sees the plaintext — so it has to arrive with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request or not at all.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"srpEnrollment"},{"text":" it replaces this performs I\/O: one ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/start"},{"text":" round trip.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OPAQUE’s envelope is sealed under the server’s oblivious PRF, so there is no offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"computation that produces a valid record.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the parameters that are gone. There is no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identity"},{"type":"text","text":": the SRP version required the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"username","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and an email there produced a verifier no login could ever satisfy,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whereas a record binds to a credential identifier the server chooses. And there is no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"group"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"params"},{"type":"text","text":", because those come from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/start"},{"type":"text","text":" response — a caller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot pick a cost the server will not honour."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Throws","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when the tenant has OPAQUE disabled, when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi"},{"type":"text","text":" is not installed, or when the server names a key-stretching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function this SDK cannot ask for."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Builds a registration record for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"password"},{"text":", to send with any request that sets one:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/auth\/password\/change"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/auth\/reset\/confirm"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/admin\/bootstrap"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/opaqueEnrollment(password:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/opaqueEnrollment(password:)","title":"opaqueEnrollment(password:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"opaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV","kind":"